[{"title":"家人初至京置酒庭中对雪作","author":"区大相","text":"庭霰今朝集，家筵此日开。\n不知燕地雪，犹讶故园梅。\n玉袖承花出，珠帘卷絮回。\n瑶华虽可赠，留赏上春来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21918,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"瑞儿初见雪能为诗喜示 其一","author":"区大相","text":"白雪儿能咏，同看帝苑边。\n乍连珠树密，已并玉堂悬。\n影助层城月，光摇万里天。\n更宜芸阁夕，映彩读新编。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21919,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"瑞儿初见雪能为诗喜示 其二","author":"区大相","text":"晓云双阙外，夕霰一庭中。\n絮起犹含吹，花飞更舞空。\n谢吟还汝共，郢曲为谁工。\n往岁梅关北，寒深阻塞鸿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21920,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪夕刘孙林庄四吉士过集同用梅字","author":"区大相","text":"暮雀归林尽，寒貂拥雪来。\n捲帘如却月，连骑似探梅。\n润重沾银管，花轻堕玉杯。\n更饶今夕兴，差胜剡溪回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21921,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"馆中杂咏 其一","author":"区大相","text":"英游真忝窃，胜地绝攀缘。\n树色藏书阁，花香入讲筵。\n岁售中秘帙，月费大官钱。\n载笔惭恩遇，何能即掞天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21922,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"馆中杂咏 其二","author":"区大相","text":"瑶圃为藏室，蓬莱即道山。\n地幽尘境外，心远市朝间。\n客至聊烹茗，书成但闭关。\n何须拂衣去，身世已投闲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21923,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"馆中杂咏 其三","author":"区大相","text":"春水通银汉，长桥跨玉河。\n散衙人吏少，归院苑云多。\n凤阁移新柳，龙池出小荷。\n自惭多吉士，联步咏卷阿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21924,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"馆中杂咏 其四","author":"区大相","text":"槐院披丹磴，芸窗网碧纱。\n帘垂仙苑柳，墙压御沟花。\n走墨和甘露，飞文散绮霞。\n良时多载酒，谁过子云家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21925,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"馆中杂咏 其五","author":"区大相","text":"侍史趋清禁，承恩下直庐。\n瓶馀赊得酒，架积赐来书。\n刻凤才何有，雕虫习未除。\n由来少尘事，寂寞意何如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21926,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"馆中杂咏 其六","author":"区大相","text":"儒雅先朝重，风云汉苑过。\n琼章悬日月，银榜拂星河。\n竹长成龙节，桐高集凤柯。\n如闻访道日，重和白云歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21927,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"馆中杂咏 其七","author":"区大相","text":"依隐便山性，幽栖养谷神。\n暂为芸阁吏，终作草堂人。\n种竹消长夏，听莺过暮春。\n林端有双鹤，潇洒类闲身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21928,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"馆中杂咏 其八","author":"区大相","text":"徐步登云阁，栖心傍药阑。\n院幽琴作伴，阶静鹤相看。\n藜火分宵读，柴门过午餐。\n儿童相顾笑，不省是何官。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21929,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"馆中杂咏 其九","author":"区大相","text":"经旬不出户，幽事亦何能。\n汲水尝新茗，攀花引古藤。\n避人常谢病，得酒便呼朋。\n若问为官意，闲门寂似僧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21930,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"馆中杂咏 其十","author":"区大相","text":"偶从方朔侍，颇识子云奇。\n散帙尘来少，窥书鸟去迟。\n囊中寻旧草，马上续新诗。\n惟有江湖兴，闲窗独坐时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21931,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"馆中杂咏 其十一","author":"区大相","text":"怅然不得意，隐几对前山。\n谢病攀云出，寻僧累日还。\n石泉留策听，竹户映花关。\n忆与溪翁别，相期云水间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21932,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"馆中杂咏 其十二","author":"区大相","text":"湖西数百寺，双屐屡追寻。\n水绕芙蓉塔，山围薝卜林。\n千钟流木杪，万宇结峰阴。\n不为官多暇，知余空赏心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21933,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"馆中杂咏 其十三","author":"区大相","text":"近得论文友，幽期竹下深。\n风前同奏雅，天上待知音。\n仙袂披云接，华轩带月临。\n不能赓妙咏，端坐思瑶琴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21934,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"馆中杂咏 其十四","author":"区大相","text":"簿领知无分，文章自有家。\n忙时惟笔札，散地即烟霞。\n褊性淮南橘，閒情杜曲花。\n幽盟关物理，疲马恋休衙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21935,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游慈寿寺","author":"区大相","text":"金地出城布，琼檐绕塔回。\n名花天女供，仙果御园来。\n松荫谈经石，禽窥施饭台。\n晚来清禁月，长照法轮开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21936,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题别山长老精舍","author":"区大相","text":"演法开精舍，焚香谒紫微。\n隔林期鹤返，持钵咒龙归。\n云表流天乐，宫中赐衲衣。\n犹看卓锡处，松下玉泉飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21937,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠许太初","author":"区大相","text":"方书与素琴，共有古人心。\n贻我青囊诀，聆君白雪音。\n烟霞驱病色，山水涤烦襟。\n何日炼金鼎，相携就竹林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21938,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春暮即事","author":"区大相","text":"春光今日暮，春恨此时长。\n泉响过仙院，苔文蚀画墙。\n庭馀一鸟啭，林剩几花香。\n紫燕忙何事，衔泥向玉堂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21939,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"慈寿寺","author":"区大相","text":"禅宫当径口，终日有轮蹄。\n万宝栽为树，千花丛若蹊。\n香分夷国贡，鸟亦禁林栖。\n不识西来路，王城此向西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21940,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚至碧云寺","author":"区大相","text":"松房碧云里，云壑昼凄凄。\n山翠席间落，雨花檐外低。\n清钟疏古木，香涧拂晴霓。\n晚步泉亭月，分明到虎溪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21941,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辛卯中秋家人置酒亭中玩月","author":"区大相","text":"秋月正宜看，秋城夜未阑。\n闺人张宴待，稚子捲帘欢。\n东壁蟾光入，中庭练影寒。\n年来种桂意，移傍五云端。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21942,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辛卯重九城西禅林登眺 其一","author":"区大相","text":"燕郊载酒日，汉殿佩萸时。\n强赴重阳会，元无三径资。\n寒城淡古木，返景透疏篱。\n寂寞龙山后，柴桑与我期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21943,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辛卯重九城西禅林登眺 其二","author":"区大相","text":"清霜涂峻坂，晚日下西岑。\n客舍黄花满，关门红叶深。\n亲朋九日饮，乡土百年心。\n落帽胡为者，风流直至今。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21944,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春郊即事","author":"区大相","text":"汉署逃名客，津桥行乐人。\n云山一片紫，花树几重春。\n章绶纷为累，琴樽且畅神。\n啼莺与芳草，处处动游轮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21945,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚春郊宴","author":"区大相","text":"柳外一纶巾，莺啼欲暮春。\n鸣琴稀俗客，持酌劝佳宾。\n四十无闻老，乾坤有限身。\n试看花下宴，谁是百年人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21946,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病起客至言西郊花事已过怅然有作 其一","author":"区大相","text":"移疾动经旬，宁知花事新。\n烟霞不惜赏，桃李可怜春。\n底事催莺老，非关送酒频。\n向来迟暮意，为此重伤神。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21947,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病起客至言西郊花事已过怅然有作 其二","author":"区大相","text":"西郊万树杏，飘落任西东。\n颇恨前朝雨，深愁昨夜风。\n游蜂争堕蕊，舞蝶恋虚丛。\n老鬓将残艳，相怜晓镜中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21948,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻宁夏变起","author":"区大相","text":"近传宁夏卒，杀将乃横行。\n养虎虽贻患，操戈亦有名。\n预愁勾逆虏，遂恐失坚城。\n柳外清笳曲，谁吹塞上声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21949,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梁武库经略河陇回","author":"区大相","text":"远闻乘障返，遽睹入关行。\n出塞三边静，归朝万户轻。\n偏师全汉地，间道走胡兵。\n不听从军曲，谁知苦乐情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21950,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柬张太仆质卿","author":"区大相","text":"昔会即分离，追欢能几时。\n风尘一诺重，湖海十年思。\n绿发君先达，青云我后期。\n匣中龙气在，曾辱茂先知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21951,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送韩伯仪守高邮","author":"区大相","text":"使君朝拥传，筮仕即专城。\n隔座见摇楫，开堂闻濯缨。\n湖光连海阔，河润过淮明。\n莫厌逢迎地，中和听颂声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21952,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"林开先内翰宅酌别孙令之修仁","author":"区大相","text":"华堂一樽酒，叙此平生心。\n赠以歌前扇，聆君花下琴。\n湘山入县远，漓水过家深。\n莫畏冲炎瘴，清风在桂林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21953,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨后过张太仆","author":"区大相","text":"高斋双塔下，来往惬幽期。\n近寺鸣钟夕，遥林过雨时。\n马蹄冲溜滑，蝉响入秋悲。\n莫下忧时泪，朝骖我自疲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21954,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立秋日雨中","author":"区大相","text":"旧侣惬相寻，凉飙动禁林。\n秋因一叶早，交以十年深。\n片雨生幽事，层城下夕阴。\n瑶琴多逸思，长愿嗣徽音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21955,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初秋夜同林太史过萧太史书斋","author":"区大相","text":"结庐虽傍市，种竹近成林。\n乍到安禅地，终谐大隐心。\n开轩迎苑月，隔牖度城砧。\n已惬山泉赏，何须云壑寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21956,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日同开先正甫出郭行经郊坛","author":"区大相","text":"清秋原野旷，旷望极瑶岑。\n七月郊坛路，千年松桧林。\n听鸡知洞浅，别鹤入山深。\n辇道苔生处，遥思羽盖临。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21957,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送胡孟韬之沅江 其一","author":"区大相","text":"萧条官舍远，况值楚山秋。\n杜牧言何罪，长沙涕自流。\n澧兰清客思，沅芷动乡愁。\n词赋从来地，君无薄此游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21958,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送胡孟韬之沅江 其二","author":"区大相","text":"浮湘明日事，江畔莫行吟。\n易动骚人怨，难为国士心。\n秋风吹芷岸，落日暗枫林。\n知有还家梦，浔阳九派深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21959,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西风","author":"区大相","text":"西风动万里，羁客不禁秋。\n送雁过关塞，惊尘上戍楼。\n乍嘶胡马动，谩捲汉旌愁。\n辛苦防秋卒，黄沙战未休。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21960,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送薛行人宣慰朝鲜 其一","author":"区大相","text":"我皇元慎德，夷服自交侵。\n受命存箕国，持诏去鸡林。\n风烟辽海阔，雨露绿江深。\n莫使楼船将，功名传至今。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21961,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送薛行人宣慰朝鲜 其二","author":"区大相","text":"夷君沦草莽，归命似穷猿。\n辍食天朝义，持危明主恩。\n饮冰将去节，航海望归轩。\n职贡周封旧，长令守外藩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21962,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日偕诸客八里庄登眺饮非幻上人众芳亭","author":"区大相","text":"陶公爱九日，而我一樽随。\n郊寺隐松叶，主僧开菊篱。\n背人南雁疾，留客晚钟迟。\n莫上高台望，台高多所思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21963,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送薛行人持诏南楚便归岭外 其一","author":"区大相","text":"西夏昨纵横，王师命有征。\n三时疲士马，四海望升平。\n朔雪吹饶入，江云拥传行。\n王程君莫缓，拜舞万方情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21964,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送薛行人持诏南楚便归岭外 其二","author":"区大相","text":"边事劳行役，秋冬两戒辀。\n方回辽左使，复作楚南游。\n雪树江关驿，云帆海国楼。\n仍闻下诏日，父老共销忧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21965,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送曾中舍持诏南归 其一","author":"区大相","text":"龙庭收羽檄，凤沼出丝纶。\n正睹三边静，还同四海春。\n别筵梅送雪，归骑柳窥人。\n遥想逢迎处，普天无战尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21966,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送曾中舍持诏南归 其二","author":"区大相","text":"汉诏下甘泉，宣传定朔边。\n马随龙节远，莺待凤池迁。\n草暖江南路，冰消蓟北天。\n帝城风日好，会报使车旋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21967,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"以诗代书寄张羽王 其一","author":"区大相","text":"美人家何在，言住湘川湄。\n独立叹无与，采芳何所遗。\n春情寄瑶瑟，幽怨结江蓠。\n频夜寻君梦，云山九处疑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21968,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"以诗代书寄张羽王 其二","author":"区大相","text":"所思在桂林，欲往隔湘阴。\n岁暮书仍阻，春来水更深。\n无由展言宴，何以托飞沉。\n不见倾城色，空传绝代音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21969,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送张仆卿还桂林","author":"区大相","text":"还朝能几日，去国逼残年。\n别路春前酒，离亭雪后天。\n衡阳随去雁，湘浦问归船。\n未是投闲日，东山卧莫坚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21970,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"林咨伯太史移居北邻作此奉简","author":"区大相","text":"近卜宫西宅，君来就竹扉。\n门同垂苑柳，壁共挂朝衣。\n联骑寻花出，双星伴月归。\n天涯好邻并，不觉宦情微。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21971,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"田家即事","author":"区大相","text":"自从服官后，耕稼废田园。\n偶出看农事，高谈坐树根。\n暝云捎雨急，归雀掠檐喧。\n立望牛羊径，依然谷口村。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21972,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚渡浑河寻宝林寺","author":"区大相","text":"人天若远近，欲往更沉沉。\n问水寻沙界，看山入宝林。\n板桥昏骇马，松径晚惊禽。\n此是西来路，恒河更几深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21973,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮投宝林禅室赠彻上人","author":"区大相","text":"平明驱下泽，昏黑渡危桥。\n只为迷方久，非关觉路遥。\n莲灯明丈室，香饭具僧瓢。\n不待闻钟梵，先令尘虑消。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21974,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题宝林寺宾上人兰若","author":"区大相","text":"老僧延客处，松色映袈裟。\n禅坐栖山鸟，经行踏涧花。\n烟萝侵径狭，溪水到门斜。\n莫谓无车马，津梁涉更赊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21975,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"香山寺","author":"区大相","text":"云门披雾磴，石脉响流泉。\n殿阁衔山转，香萝拂径悬。\n盘松低覆地，复道上摩天。\n向晚生幽思，长林起夕烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21976,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登来青轩","author":"区大相","text":"层轩翠微里，宸翰此高题。\n仰见星辰列，平看云雾低。\n路盘陵树北，山拥帝城西。\n万乘来游地，应无七圣迷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21977,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"碧云寺水亭晚坐","author":"区大相","text":"落日松亭上，疏钟云外清。\n泉源随径转，溪月枕流明。\n洗钵闻花气，开林散鸟声。\n坐来尘境寂，弥觉世缘轻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21978,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送陈任夫司训天台","author":"区大相","text":"闻子谈经处，高斋连翠微。\n明霞胜绛帐，飞瀑浣儒衣。\n白日松坛静，春风鼓瑟希。\n闲携童冠出，华顶咏而归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21979,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得舍弟春来行县诸诗","author":"区大相","text":"政暇元吾弟，乘春或下堂。\n弦歌为宰遍，布令出郊长。\n绕郭为驯雉，他时必爱棠。\n采风何日至，勿剪和歌章。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21980,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋诸客过集是夕余病初起","author":"区大相","text":"主人今强起，众客且为欢。\n共是天涯望，谁堪枕上看。\n香风出桂苑，冷露濯金盘。\n乞取长生药，何人住广寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21981,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻郡国被灾东明弟拮据荒政百尔劳瘁遥有此寄","author":"区大相","text":"忆弟心如岁，忧时发欲星。\n衣裳带月入，涕泪及秋零。\n小邑歌鸿雁，高原起鹡鸰。\n忽闻颂声作，频使客愁醒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21982,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送梁进士宰零陵","author":"区大相","text":"潇湘新试令，家在潇湘南。\n雁去犹逾岭，凫来不假骖。\n琴声二水月，厅事九疑岚。\n莫以零陵草，还轻玳瑁簪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21983,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"癸巳九日同焦弱侯周季平吴会甫董玄宰林咨伯庄得全六太史携酒兴德寺后池台 其一","author":"区大相","text":"野寺堆红叶，秋原隐白蒿。\n乡遥愁望远，病起强登高。\n为客惭乌帽，随人试浊醪。\n逢时聊引兴，能赋愧词曹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21984,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"癸巳九日同焦弱侯周季平吴会甫董玄宰林咨伯庄得全六太史携酒兴德寺后池台 其二","author":"区大相","text":"杖屦侵霜叶，壶觞就径花。\n高风疏薜荔，薄雾隐蒹葭。\n山绕层城暮，桥通小苑斜。\n正逢边雁下，西北有尘沙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21985,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋望","author":"区大相","text":"野兴因高发，羁怀逐望舒。\n暮霞红蓟叶，秋水白漳渠。\n去雁冲风尽，寒花对酒疏。\n三年频忆处，赢得数行书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":21986,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]